<%- include("websitepartials/header") %>
<main class="main">
  <!-- Page Title -->
  <div
    class="page-title dark-background"
    style="
      background-image: url(website-assets/img/gallery/Dr-Basilia-Igbokwe3.jpg);
    "
  >
    <div class="container position-relative">
      <h1>ICT Directorate</h1>
      <p>
        Explore our key administrative units driving strategic leadership,
        innovation, and institutional growth.
      </p>

      <nav class="breadcrumbs">
        <ol>
          <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
          <li class="current">Directorates</li>
        </ol>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- End Page Title -->

  <!-- History Section -->
  <section id="history" class="history section">
    <div class="container" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="100">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <div class="about-content" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
            <h3>ICT Directorate</h3>
            <h2>Empowering Education Through Technology</h2>
            <p>
              UISTO ICT Directorate is responsible for conceiving, designing,
              and implementing ICT strategies for the polytechnic via the
              deployment of human capacities and provision of critical
              infrastructure and network services. The ICT Directorate helps
              staff and students use information and communication technologies
              to enhance their work and offers different services and support.
            </p>

            <h3>Our Mission</h3>
            <div class="timeline">
              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>Attending to all administrative issues.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Providing leadership in planning and developing the
                    Polytechnic information systems.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Using Information Technology in connecting students,
                    faculty, staff, and other stakeholders with operational and
                    strategic information resources.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Providing Polytechnic-wide support for all computing
                    resources.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Automating systems monitoring tasks using standard
                    monitoring tools.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Making provisions for Server hardware, including
                    configuration and deployment.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Data backup management, which includes scheduling and
                    reporting for both internal Polytechnic systems and data
                    center system.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Troubleshooting and support for Polytechnic cyber operations
                    such as websites, SFTP sites, e-voting sites, SMTP services
                    and Polytechnic intranet.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Providing technical support for web development projects.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>Establish systems standards, policies, and procedures.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Creating and maintaining systems configuration and work flow
                    diagrams.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Designing and implementing security measures against
                    cyber-attacks and malware.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="timeline-item">
                <div class="timeline-dot"></div>
                <div class="timeline-content">
                  <p>
                    Responding to requests for help and inquiries from website
                    visitors and website designers.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <h3>Our Vision</h3>
          <p>
            The Vision of the ICT Directorate is to become a world-class center
            of excellence where the potential of ICT is harnessed to transform
            the institution into an automated work environment that supports
            research and development to provide a customer-centered ICT and
            business development services.
          </p>
          <div class="about-image" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="300">
            <div
              style="position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 50%"
            >
              <img
                src="website-assets/img/council/ijeoma-ict.png"
                alt="ict-director"
                class="img-fluid"
                style="
                  width: 100%;
                  height: 100%;
                  object-fit: cover;
                  border-radius: 50%;
                "
              />

              <div
                style="
                  position: absolute;
                  bottom: 0;
                  left: 0;
                  right: 0;
                  background: rgba(10, 130, 184, 0.9);
                  color: #fff;
                  text-align: center;
                  padding: 8px 10px;
                  font-size: 24px;
                  border-bottom-left-radius: 50%;
                  border-bottom-right-radius: 50%;
                "
              >
                <strong>Dr. Ijeoma Emeagi</strong><br />
                <i>(Nee Agwamba)</i>
                <div>ICT DIRECTOR</div>
              </div>
            </div>

