                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="vision">
                <h3>Value Proposition</h3>
                <p>
                  We aim to add measurable value to the Polytechnic’s mission by
                  enabling smart solutions, ensuring data integrity, and
                  supporting seamless digital experiences.
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

