                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="col">
                <div class="value-card">
                  <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="bi bi-cpu"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h4>Systems Management</h4>
                  <p>
                    We manage data backup, server provisioning, monitoring, and
