                  <h4>Academic Resources</h4>
                  <p>
                    We facilitate access to library e-resources, e-journals, and
                    Student Information Management System.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="col">
                <div class="value-card">
                  <div class="value-icon">
                    <i class="bi bi-chat-dots"></i>
                  </div>
                  <h4>Technical Assistance</h4>
                  <p>
                    We provide responsive support and guidance for users of the
                    Polytechnic’s digital services.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>
